WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.481
A short appointment can overlap two different commitment s

00:00:04.415 --> 00:00:08.231
The response must fit the facts Now examine the

00:00:08.284 --> 00:00:12.073
timing evidence in the Monday case It is easy

00:00:12.139 --> 00:00:14.442
to spot that a diary is busy and still

00:00:14.455 --> 00:00:18.113
miss the exact loss of preparation We will put

00:00:18.139 --> 00:00:21.284
the requested supplier time beside the existing blocks and

00:00:21.323 --> 00:00:24.560
identify both conflicts before recommending a change
